nds.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Movie Buff Certification",\n      "description": "Level-based certification quiz with timed challenges, score history, and shareable results.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#D32F2F",\n    "secondary": "#212121",\n    "accent": "#FFD600"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a modern, vibrant dashboard with a Kollywood theme. The homepage displays game cards for each game mode. Users can access their profile, score history, and leaderboards from the top navigation. Each game launches in a modal or dedicated page with clear instructions and interactive elements. Bright accent colors highlight actions and progress. Responsive design ensures usability on desktop and mobile."\n}'}",
